Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.87,0:00:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sorcerer who erected the barrier here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This spot has been chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For people to kill each other in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's\Nno real honor in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.69,0:00:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you possibly find another\Nneighborhood to do that in please?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were\Nsuch a funny kid there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an old execution site\Nnot too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.55,0:00:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It serves as the center of the barrier\Nit covers a five or six kilometer radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went through great pains to create\Nthis barrier so I can't impose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,restrictions that are too\NUnreasonable anyone who was inside the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:01:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,barrier when I created it has the\Nright to leave it if They want but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just once if you wish right now you\Ncould wake up outside the barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to do that wake up\Noutside the barrier is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The space between dreams\Nand reality is a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be careful. Easy. Take it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most impatient ones are\Nalready outside waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I nearly forgot to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being friends with my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sasaki! Sasaki! Sasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iiguchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere between Grade\Nand Hiroshi Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, what's your opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an occult club member.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I tell you about a dream I had?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy with long hair and a kasaya, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he also thank you for\Nbeing friends with his son?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's the first\Ntime I heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See our Jujutsu and see our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are bright and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My love lives only.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your passion remains!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This brings you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gelect bias.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it brings us a bit. We are weary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope your love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,. . . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High Tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yerlo-la.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me Love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me Love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chame it. Chame it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I call ice for fun in my death?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bambas won no yore shuaiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sarabama da haimashou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,known i'm sorry for not\Ntelling you sooner but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:05:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's true it's all right\Nthough itadori it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in shibuya he fought\Nwith the higher-ups after
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that well that doesn't\Nmake it any better you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know i mean after all the\Nprinciple was like you're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah that's what i meant\Nby it's all right itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's nice of you\Nwell if you say you're all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right then fine there's\Nnothing more for us to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, you're talking about\Neveryone who's ever been good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been this\Nbummed out since I watched
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yakul got shot in the ass with an arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice life you've lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then, I'm gonna help\Nyou all stop this culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong though, I'm\Nnot doing this out of sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're cutting a deal here, understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we clean up this\Nculling game for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's gonna be your turn to\Nhelp me out with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get in on the revisions\Nto the jujutsu regulations, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the existence of\Ncurses has gone public,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:06:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's sure to be some\Nkind of revisions made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what exactly are you hoping for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I doubt we'll have\Nmuch trouble doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.73,0:06:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a load of sea urchin head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you know about anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I am the new head of the Zenin clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the three crazy things I learned\Ntoday, this one's the craziest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I got the backing of one\Nof the big three families,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could easily influence the\Nrevisions to the regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only problem would come\Nlater in trying to keep the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zenin clan from getting involved\Nin managing the Fight Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea Urchin Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name's Fushiguro. Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, let's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just leaves deciding\Nwho's heading to which colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two went to Miyagi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ding dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be advised,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.77,0:07:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,effective immediately, a player has\Nadded a new rule to the calling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rule number nine, players will\Nknow each other's information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First names, last names,\Nnumber of points accumulated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,current colony, and number of\Nroles added to the game by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Kogane, a liaison between\Nplayers and the Culling Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.03,0:07:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that thing just change\Npersonalities halfway through?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first part was an announcement\Nfrom the Culling Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I am speaking as the personal\Nliaison attached to the player Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tangan did say something about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This year for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is Itadori already being counted\Nas one of the players in the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aside from those Kenjaku gave\Ncursed techniques and objects to,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at this point the only players should\Nbe those who have entered a colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were people whom I\Nhad absorbed cursed objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cursed objects that I distributed\Nare what's left of the sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I've been secretly packed\Nwith more than just sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he once existed as\Nan actual human being,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although it was over a thousand\Nyears ago. Sukuna. Sukuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna was one of the\Nsorcerers that forged
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a pact with Kenjaku to\Nbecome cursed objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet calling game participation\Nwas included in their pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.05,0:08:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things still aren't adding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You swallowed Sukuna's\Nfinger of your own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I witnessed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Table that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, can you have Kogane pull\Nup the players' information for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he originally had 200 points?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he was hoping\Nfor by adding a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, he must have\Nkilled about 40 people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:09:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the reason, we\Ncan assume it wasn't nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.11,0:09:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can still help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could use the player's info to progress
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the culling game\Nwithout killing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane, can you show me a list of\Nthe players with 100 points or more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.81,0:09:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I am attached to\Nthe player Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, he can use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever he asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless someone's in a rush\Nto escape the barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.15,0:09:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like Tsumiki who got caught up in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reincarnated\Nsorcerers must have forged
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,packs with Kenjaku for their own reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.77,0:09:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they're not necessarily\Nmotivated to make this move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, if there's anyone else with\Nan excess of 100 points like Kashimo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those with 100 points and no\Nintention of adding a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can lean on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make them add a rule to let\NSuniki escape the culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we'll take advantage\Nof the Rule 8 obstacle. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remind me what Rule 8 was again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,players who don't show a\Nchange in points within
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,19 days shall be stripped\Nof their technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the rule that leads to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.47,0:10:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we add a rule that\Nsays it is now possible
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for players to transfer\Npoints among each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way, if they keep passing\Npoints amongst themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can avoid being stripped\Nof their techniques and dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we add one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rule will sound something like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if players spend enough points, it will\Nallow them to leave the culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that would conflict with\Nthe rule about the continuation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the game, wouldn't it,\Nand we find a workaround, how
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about we had some kind of\Nflexible condition to the rule
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like dragging in a non-player\Nof the game to take their place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would Kogane be making the call on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, we know\Nwhat we need to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're searching for the angel\Nto break the prison realm seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll look for Hajime Akashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hunt them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not seeing an\Nangel anywhere on this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's probably not her real name,\Njust like you're not listed as Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tengen said she was in eastern Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would mean colony number two, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys know what she looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, we'll know\Nher when we see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, whatever, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda and I will take Tokyo number\Ntwo, Fushiguro and Itadori number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.43,0:11:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Kirara standby outside the barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your reasoning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.19,0:11:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just going by points, this\NKashimo's the strongest one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it makes sense for me to take him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that I'm left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda, you've got a keen nose, so\Nfocus on sniffing out the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that we haven't\Nalready heard from Okotsu means
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we probably can't use cell\Nphones inside the barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that's why we need someone keeping\Ntabs on what's going on outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:11:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be better for me and Fushiguro\Nto split up, because if Sue can...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of the older students\Ncan change the roles they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So quit being selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.37,0:12:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one worrying about you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.87,0:12:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, how many times do\NI have to listen to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a played excuse and a\Nwaste of time. Yeah? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna fight or dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, I am Kogane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking place inside this\Nbarrier is the culling game,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where players fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you decide to step inside,\Nyou too become a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still willing to enter\Nand risk everything you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On me, Amai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep waiting for your signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I hear you, but\Nthere's no signal to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do much if no one shows up. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mouthing off to me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.27,0:13:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're getting all high and mighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pull you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to be careful of the\Nsorcerers who've reincarnated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just in case I've\Nforgotten, explain again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of them are from\Na thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one or two hundred years\Nago, they valued life way less.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.77,0:13:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, they're sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.43,0:13:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting and death are common for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some may want to die fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might even be why they\Nforged a pact with Kenjaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet that Higuruma and\NKashimo are past sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't expect fair negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then other attacks\Ncome from cursed spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if there are modern-day sorcerers\Ndragged into this, like Sumiki was,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they might actually be open to\Nexchanging information with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, my name is Kogane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking place inside this\Nbarrier is the culling game,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where players fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you decide to step inside,\Nyou too become a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still willing to enter\Nand risk everything you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi Fushiguro has now\Nofficially joined the Culling Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see the rules first?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boo. Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First we have to gather\Ninformation on Higuruma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready for this? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a player enters one of\Nthe Culling Game's barriers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're randomly teleported to one of nine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,designated locations where\Nthey will begin the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a rule of the barriers not included\Nin the general rules of the culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And others were waiting in those\Nnine locations. Here's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a name for\Nplayers who target those
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disoriented by this\Nunmentioned phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Newbie Hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tougher than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would have pulverized most guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's still kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's no ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darling, let's meet up, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She fell pretty easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to ask her about Higuruma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I have to find Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to my woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I can just ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Nahaba flew in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean Hanyu was taken out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've seen that guy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, that hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know if I can stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.87,0:16:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're the one who attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect us to\Nget separated that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nui can't find him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This colony must be larger than Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're probably over two kilometers apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we both know where to head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know a sorcerer named Higuruma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.31,0:16:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You men are all alike, thinking you could\Njust beat a woman into listening to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could be a different Higuruma, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine has a hundred points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the one. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd be in trouble with him\Nconstantly holding higher ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that propeller is\Nhis only means of attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He keeps trying to get\Nclose enough to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to fight him indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:17:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to be a smoothie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's turned his head toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.43,0:18:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman from earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was sturdy enough to smash\Nthrough buildings with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a simple thrown object made her fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet their hair is the key\Nto their cursed techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The further away from the\Nhair, the less sturdy they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd they become this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it part of a pact?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter how tough their hair is,\Nit's still attached to their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.01,0:18:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broke your fist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause you just lost this battle! Eww!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.37,0:18:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't break anything,\Nit's just a scratch. Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind telling you\Nwhere to find Higuruma,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want you to do me a favor in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.31,0:19:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.27,0:19:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or thank you. Or... Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you be my knight,\Nplease? Sure. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're no fun at all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm walking front.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even know what a knight is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My knight is supposed to protect\Nme with his life, if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, if you're telling me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you about a\Nsorcerer named Higuruma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Higuruma guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not like Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:20:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to earn those\N100 points on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I do have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that name is Remy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does he know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it was just me who knew about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're famous after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiger of West Middle. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from my hometown?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you're not\Na sorcerer from the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.07,0:20:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do these clothes look old-fashioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.81,0:20:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's your rationale\Nfor attacking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.79,0:20:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whole lot of average people who weren't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.57,0:20:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,players suddenly got\Nlet out of the colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the players like me who were\Nin the colony from the start
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have had to participate in the\Ncalling game for 12 days already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this because I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.49,0:20:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out here it's kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or be killed. You can get\Nkilled while trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.95,0:21:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find a reason to fight 12\Ndays out here has taught
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me that i've seen plenty\Nof people drown in their
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power so far so stop trying\Nto differentiate between
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them as past or present\Nsorcerers so the sorcerers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the past have inspired\Nthe modern day sorcerers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to go into battle mode\Nin that case i gave it to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.99,0:21:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dory bad advice you sure\NWhat about those other two?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were allies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.21,0:21:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I was just their gopher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would have killed me at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough blind following.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.31,0:21:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What guarantee do I have you won't kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right after I tell you\Nwhere to find Higuruma?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.17,0:21:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Amai. Rin Amai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do if\Nyou die before we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.29,0:21:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to be my knight and protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And use my name already. Just\Ncovering my bases, am I where exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can i find higuruma Okay fine\Ni'll give you a rough idea of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.89,0:22:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where we're going the stronger\Npeople are gathered In what used
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be the heart of the city it's\Nwhere most of the supplies are
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma-zen, Ikebukuro,\NShinjuku. Got it? Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.95,0:23:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.89,0:23:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be afraid to die again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll forget to be back on the last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.35,0:23:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the same tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the same for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the same for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.69,0:23:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.91,0:23:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.45,0:23:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.36,0:23:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she deceived you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.51,0:23:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.43,0:23:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sorcerer connected to Kenjaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.29,0:23:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.23,0:23:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're having a retrial.

